codex-browser — drive the sandbox-external browser. Output is bounded (large results saved to disk).
COMMANDS
  open <url>              load a page (e.g. open http://127.0.0.1:PORT/)
  url | title             current url / page title
  state                   compact JSON from the app's diagnostics hook (window.__AGENT_STATE__)
  eval <js...>            run a JS expression in the page → bounded JSON   (e.g. eval document.title)
  get <path>              read window.<path>; dots ok  (e.g. get __AGENT_STATE__.player.x)
  click-id <id>           click #<id>       |  click <sel>   |  type <sel> <text>
  key <k> | press <k>     one key press (e.g. key f)         |  hold <k> <ms>  (held movement)
  screenshot [file]       save PNG to file; prints path + sha256 + bytes
  snapshot                a11y + visible text + controls (bounded)
  console | errors | network-errors     recent page logs (bounded)
  reload | close | health
